cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If MARCUS helps your work, please cite the paper below."
title: "MARCUS: Molecular Annotation and Recognition for Curating Unravelled Structures"
abstract: >-
  MARCUS turns chemistry papers (PDF) into checked chemical structures for the
  COCONUT natural products database. It finds every structure drawing, reads it
  with several recognition engines (DECIMER, MolScribe, MolParser), annotates the
  text with the MARCUS model, reads R-group tables and builds their compounds,
  and puts a person in charge of accepting, fixing or rejecting each structure.
